  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds Proceeds received by the Trust\nfrom the issuance of Creation Baskets consist of bitcoin, or cash. Deposits of bitcoin are held by the Bitcoin Custodian on behalf of\nthe Trust. Field: Page; Sequence: 15; Value: 2 - Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo 9 Field: /Sequence - Field: /Page Principal Investment Risks of an Investment\nin the Trust An investment in the Trust\ninvolves a high degree of risk. Some of the risks you may face are summarized below. A more extensive discussion of these risks appears\nbeginning on page 11. \u00b7 The trading prices of many digital assets, including\nbitcoin, have experienced extreme volatility in recent periods and may continue to do so. Extreme volatility in the future, including\nfurther declines in the trading prices of bitcoin, could have a material adverse effect on the value of the Shares and the Shares could\nlose all or substantially",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
